WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
On the real humanoid platform, HOIST runs autonomously. The robot faces a suspended gray box hanging above a wooden platform with an outlined target.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The robot reaches toward the suspended box and brings its hands to the side of the load as it descends.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
The robot guides the lowering box with its hands, adjusting its arms and stance as the box moves toward the outlined target.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.800
The box reaches the platform, showing the HOIST placement. This recording shows autonomous policy execution at the original playback speed.
